			"locked": false,
			"text": "🔹 Throughput\n\nDefinition:\n\nNumber of requests or\noperations the system can\nhandle per unit time.\n\nExample:\n\n10,000 requests per second\n(RPS)",
			"rawText": "🔹 Throughput\n\nDefinition:\n\nNumber of requests or operations the system can handle per unit time.\n\nExample:\n\n10,000 requests per second (RPS)",
