			"updated": 1772950605980,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "🔹 Durability\n\nDefinition:\n\nGuarantee that once data is\nwritten, it will not be lost\neven after crashes.\n\nExample:\n\nData survives server restart",
			"rawText": "🔹 Durability\n\nDefinition:\n\nGuarantee that once data is written, it will not be lost even after crashes.\n\nExample:\n\nData survives server restart",
			"fontSize": 28,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "center",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "VC-GHLOrEeS3Df-cCkRyL",
			"originalText": "🔹 Durability\n\nDefinition:\n\nGuarantee that once data is written, it will not be lost even after crashes.\n\nExample:\n\nData survives server restart",
