			"updated": 1769881109960,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "🔹 Scalability\n\nDefinition:\n\nAbility of the system to\nhandle increased load by\nadding resources.\n\nExample:\n\nAdding more servers to\nhandle more users",
			"rawText": "🔹 Scalability\n\nDefinition:\n\nAbility of the system to handle increased load by adding resources.\n\nExample:\n\nAdding more servers to handle more users",
			"fontSize": 28,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "center",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "GZmiRDt0T--RJ4y1UrwqB",
			"originalText": "🔹 Scalability\n\nDefinition:\n\nAbility of the system to handle increased load by adding resources.\n\nExample:\n\nAdding more servers to handle more users",
			"autoResize": true,
