			"locked": false,
			"text": "Chat Application\n\n. Message delivery latency must be under 200 ms\n\n. System must handle 1 million messages per minute\n\n. Messages must be reliable (no message loss)\n\n. System must support eventual consistency for read receipts",
			"rawText": "Chat Application\n\n. Message delivery latency must be under 200 ms\n\n. System must handle 1 million messages per minute\n\n. Messages must be reliable (no message loss)\n\n. System must support eventual consistency for read receipts",
