			"updated": 1769881408559,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "🔹 Fault Tolerance\n\nDefinition:\n\nAbility of a system to\ncontinue operating even when\nsome components fail.\n\nFault tolerance = system keeps\nworking despite failures\n\nExample:\n\nOne server crashes, system\nstill serves users",
			"rawText": "🔹 Fault Tolerance\n\nDefinition:\n\nAbility of a system to continue operating even when some components fail.\n\nFault tolerance = system keeps working despite failures\n\nExample:\n\nOne server crashes, system still serves users",
			"fontSize": 28,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "center",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "OlMolWgLt75DGXniHCFp9",
			"originalText": "🔹 Fault Tolerance\n\nDefinition:\n\nAbility of a system to continue operating even when some components fail.\n\nFault tolerance = system keeps working despite failures\n\nExample:\n\nOne server crashes, system still serves users",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
